Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:40.68,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 WTA1000 第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:40.68,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}莱巴金娜 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}6-4 7-6{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 弗雷赫 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.22,0:00:02.30,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just gone against her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.22,0:00:02.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,又一次 球没站在她那边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.30,0:00:04.46,EN,,0,0,0,,Rybakina eventually gets there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.30,0:00:04.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,莱巴金娜最终还是拿下了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.46,0:00:06.22,EN,,0,0,0,,But what a performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.46,0:00:06.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,但这是一场了不起的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.22,0:00:06.62,EN,,0,0,0,,Nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.22,0:00:06.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,输的一方什么都没得到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.62,0:00:10.14,EN,,0,0,0,,for the loser except sympathy applause.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.62,0:00:10.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,只有一片惋惜的掌声
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.14,0:00:12.62,EN,,0,0,0,,But boy did she push Rybakina here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.14,0:00:12.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,但她真把莱巴金娜逼到了极限
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.62,0:00:13.66,EN,,0,0,0,,It wasn't one of those days
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.62,0:00:13.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天并不是那种
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.66,0:00:15.98,EN,,0,0,0,,when Rybakina was struggling for form.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.66,0:00:15.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,莱巴金娜状态挣扎的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:17.50,EN,,0,0,0,,She was playing really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:17.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,她打得非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:19.02,EN,,0,0,0,,She reeled off service game
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:19.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,她一个接一个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.02,0:00:21.02,EN,,0,0,0,,after service game.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.02,0:00:21.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,保住了发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.02,0:00:23.02,EN,,0,0,0,,And she takes the applause from the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.02,0:00:23.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,全场为她鼓掌
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.02,0:00:25.98,EN,,0,0,0,,But what a tough win it was in two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.02,0:00:25.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场赢得很难 打了两个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.98,0:00:28.46,EN,,0,0,0,,64 76.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.98,0:00:28.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,六比四 七比六
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.46,0:00:30.78,EN,,0,0,0,,But Rybakina safely through.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.46,0:00:30.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,莱巴金娜稳稳过关
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.78,0:00:32.78,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, let's talk about staying focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.78,0:00:32.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们聊聊怎么保持专注
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.78,0:00:33.98,EN,,0,0,0,,Rain delay start.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.78,0:00:33.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,开赛前下雨延误
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.98,0:00:35.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Rain delay start again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.98,0:00:35.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后又一次延误
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:36.70,EN,,0,0,0,,Things got a little tricky today
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:36.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天的情况有点棘手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.70,0:00:38.46,EN,,0,0,0,,and then actually it's just cooling off now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.70,0:00:38.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在才刚刚凉下来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.46,0:00:39.74,EN,,0,0,0,,but during that match
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.46,0:00:39.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,但比赛进行的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.74,0:00:41.50,EN,,0,0,0,,that air was pretty thick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.74,0:00:41.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,空气闷得厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:43.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's a crazy day to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:43.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话 今天挺疯狂的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.50,0:00:45.82,EN,,0,0,0,,And it's true coming out every time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.50,0:00:45.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,每次走上球场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.82,0:00:46.94,EN,,0,0,0,,from the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.82,0:00:46.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,都是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.94,0:00:49.98,EN,,0,0,0,,It's either clouded, so humid or it's sun
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.94,0:00:49.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,要么阴天 特别闷 要么出太阳
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.18,EN,,0,0,0,,and it's burning your skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,晒得皮肤发烫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.18,0:00:53.66,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I don't know guys how you were able
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.18,0:00:53.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真不知道你们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.66,0:00:54.46,EN,,0,0,0,,to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.66,0:00:54.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,是怎么坚持坐下来的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.46,0:00:55.42,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.46,0:00:55.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,太感谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.42,0:00:58.38,EN,,0,0,0,,But it's been a very difficult one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.42,0:00:58.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,但这场确实非常艰难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.38,0:00:59.26,EN,,0,0,0,,It was tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.38,0:00:59.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,是很难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.26,0:01:01.18,EN,,0,0,0,,But Cincinnati got you through that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.26,0:01:01.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,但辛辛那提陪你扛过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.18,0:01:02.46,EN,,0,0,0,,Just take us to the end
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.18,0:01:02.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,说说这场球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:03.26,EN,,0,0,0,,of that match there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:03.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后那一段
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.26,0:01:04.62,EN,,0,0,0,,It could have gone three sets,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.26,0:01:04.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,本来可能会打满三盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:05.42,EN,,0,0,0,,three match points,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:05.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,三个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.42,0:01:07.42,EN,,0,0,0,,then it took to a tiebreaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.42,0:01:07.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后进了抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.42,0:01:09.02,EN,,0,0,0,,You just said before we came on the air
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.42,0:01:09.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,上镜之前你刚说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.02,0:01:10.86,EN,,0,0,0,,that you were happy it didn't go three sets,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.02,0:01:10.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,很高兴没有打到第三盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.86,0:01:11.42,EN,,0,0,0,,but what did you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.86,0:01:11.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,那在抢七里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:12.94,EN,,0,0,0,,have to do during that tie break
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:12.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,你得做到什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.94,0:01:15.42,EN,,0,0,0,,to make sure you took care of business?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.94,0:01:15.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,才能把它拿下来？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.42,0:01:17.34,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, I had opportunities as you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.42,0:01:17.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,就像你说的 我有过机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.34,0:01:18.62,EN,,0,0,0,,It was three match points
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.34,0:01:18.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,有三个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:21.74,EN,,0,0,0,,and honestly I felt like I'm on top
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:21.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话 我觉得自己
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.74,0:01:24.14,EN,,0,0,0,,of the ball and I was trying to keep
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.74,0:01:24.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,完全掌控着球 也一直想保持
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.14,0:01:26.30,EN,,0,0,0,,on focusing but of course when the day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.14,0:01:26.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,专注 但一天这么长
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.30,0:01:28.62,EN,,0,0,0,,is so long and when you're physically tired
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.30,0:01:28.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,身体又累的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.26,EN,,0,0,0,,it's so difficult to keep the concentration.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,保持注意力真的很难
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.26,0:01:34.06,EN,,0,0,0,,So I'm happy that in the tie break went
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.26,0:01:34.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我很高兴 抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.06,0:01:36.62,EN,,0,0,0,,my way and I was just focusing on the serve
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.06,0:01:36.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,站在了我这边 我只专注于发球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.62,0:01:40.68,EN,,0,0,0,,and trying to get as many points as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.62,0:01:40.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,尽可能多拿分
